# Festag — dark-mode CTAs (Forest Intelligence)

North star: **Execution `/dev/login` light** — clean spacing, full pills, calm green ready (`#2E9B52`).

## Geometry

Auth CTAs, fields, and portal controls use **full pills**:

```css
border-radius: 999px;
```

## Idle / secondary (dark)

Quiet transparent fill with soft hairline — never loud:

```css
background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); /* --festag-btn-dark-bg */
color: #C7D0CC;
border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
```

## Ready / primary

Only the primary action flips after valid input (e.g. PIN complete, valid email). Same green as the Execution ok badge:

```css
background: #2E9B52; /* --festag-btn-ready-bg */
color: #FFFFFF;
border: 1px solid transparent;
box-shadow: none;
```

Hover `#349E58` / active `#268A45`. Ghost / secondary stay at idle density.

## Light mode

Keep white/light fills for generic CTAs (`festag-light-mode-ctas`). Exception: Execution `/dev/login` **Anmelden** submit uses the same calm green when enabled.

## Do not

- Neon blues (`#295CFF`) as CTA fills
- Soft cool-white ready fills in dark when Execution green is intended
- Colored glow shadows
- Loud saturated mint / electric green
- Force `--ready` on empty / incomplete fields
